---
---

<section class="greenhouse" aria-labelledby="greenhouse-heading">
	<header class="section-head">
		<h2 class="section-label" id="greenhouse-heading">
			the greenhouse — bamboo edition
		</h2>
		<hr class="rule-ink" />
	</header>

	<div class="gh-row">
		<figure class="photo">
			<img
				src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788882858527-e7ea12d77c8b?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&q=80&w=1080"
				alt="Bamboo greenhouse structure with netting (photo: Yoksel Zok, Unsplash)"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</figure>

		<div class="gh-body">
			<p class="gh-para">
				The frame is local bamboo — cheap, strong enough for the channels and
				netting, and easy to reconfigure with bolts and zip ties as I learn.
				Inside: six food-grade channels on a ~3% slope, shaded with 50% net
				against the tropical sun, and every reading logged in Selada Ops.
			</p>

			<dl class="specs">
				<div class="spec">
					<dt>frame</dt>
					<dd>bamboo + galvanized bolts &amp; zip ties</dd>
				</div>
				<div class="spec">
					<dt>channels</dt>
					<dd>6 × 3 m food-grade PVC · 96 holes</dd>
				</div>
				<div class="spec">
					<dt>slope</dt>
					<dd>~3% (≈9 cm over 3 m)</dd>
				</div>
				<div class="spec">
					<dt>pump</dt>
					<dd>15 W · timer · 20 h/day</dd>
				</div>
				<div class="spec">
					<dt>tank</dt>
					<dd>500 L · shaded</dd>
				</div>
				<div class="spec">
					<dt>monitoring</dt>
					<dd>Selada Ops app + EC/pH meter</dd>
				</div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* Decorative diagram — every fact on it also lives in the specs above. */}
	<div class="schematic-scroll">
		<div class="schematic" aria-hidden="true">
			<span class="sch-caption">side view — the system, on paper</span>

			<div class="channel">
				{
					[5.128, 16.026, 26.923, 37.821, 48.718, 59.615, 70.513, 81.41, 92.308].map(
						(left) => <span class="pot" style={`left: ${left}%;`} />,
					)
				}
			</div>

			<div class="riser"></div>
			<div class="pump">15 W pump</div>
			<div class="tank">tank · 500 L</div>
			<div class="drop"></div>
			<div class="return-line"></div>

			<span class="sch-label sch-in">
				nutrient in — pushed up by the pump
			</span>
			<span class="sch-label sch-channels">
				6 channels · ~3% slope · net pots every 25 cm
			</span>
			<span class="sch-label sch-return">gravity return</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.greenhouse {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 22px;
	}

	.gh-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 380fr 560fr;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.photo {
		margin: 0;
		border-radius: 14px;
		overflow: hidden;
		aspect-ratio: 380 / 280;
		outline: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
		outline-offset: -1px;
	}

	.photo img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.gh-body {
		min-width: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.gh-para {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--color-text-body);
	}

	.specs {
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 7px;
	}

	.spec {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.spec dt {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 96px;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.71875rem;
		line-height: 1.3;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.spec dd {
		margin: 0;
		min-width: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.71875rem;
		line-height: 1.3;
		color: var(--color-ink);
	}

	.schematic-scroll {
		overflow-x: auto;
		overscroll-behavior: contain;
	}

	.schematic {
		position: relative;
		width: 964px;
		height: 210px;
		background: var(--color-schematic-bg);
		border-radius: 16px;
	}

	.schematic span {
		position: absolute;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.sch-caption {
		left: 20px;
		top: 14px;
		font-size: 10.5px;
		line-height: 1.3;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.channel {
		position: absolute;
		left: 32px;
		top: 64px;
		width: 780px;
		height: 22px;
		border-radius: 11px;
		background: var(--color-accent);
		transform: rotate(-2.5deg);
		transform-origin: top left;
	}

	.pot {
		top: 5px;
		width: 12px;
		height: 12px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--color-schematic-pot);
	}

	.riser,
	.drop {
		position: absolute;
		width: 3px;
		background: var(--color-schematic-pipe);
	}

	.riser {
		left: 806px;
		top: 34px;
		height: 92px;
	}

	.drop {
		left: 30px;
		top: 86px;
		height: 66px;
	}

	.return-line {
		position: absolute;
		left: 30px;
		top: 152px;
		width: 746px;
		height: 3px;
		background: var(--color-schematic-return);
	}

	.pump {
		position: absolute;
		left: 786px;
		top: 124px;
		width: 76px;
		height: 26px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background: var(--color-accent-deep);
		color: var(--color-cream);
		font-size: 9px;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.tank {
		position: absolute;
		left: 776px;
		top: 150px;
		width: 160px;
		height: 52px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: var(--color-schematic-tank);
		color: var(--color-accent-deep);
		font-size: 10.5px;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.sch-label {
		font-size: 10px;
		line-height: 1.3;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.sch-in {
		left: 560px;
		top: 10px;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.sch-channels {
		left: 64px;
		top: 42px;
	}

	.sch-return {
		left: 300px;
		top: 160px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.gh-row {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
